@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Ott Based System Mini Reel

[*] --> CreateAccount

state "Create account" as CreateAccount
state "Watch videos" as WatchVideos
state "Upload video" as UploadVideo
state "Save to likes list" as SaveToLikesList
state "View saved videos" as ViewSavedVideos
state "Enter discussion option" as EnterDiscussionOption

CreateAccount --> WatchVideos : Account created / Login successful
WatchVideos --> UploadVideo : User wants to upload a video
UploadVideo --> SaveToLikesList : User wants to save the video in likes list
SaveToLikesList --> ViewSavedVideos : User wants to view saved videos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussionOption : User wants to enter discussion option

EnterDiscussionOption --> [*] : Discussion started / Session ended

@enduml
